#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Igama"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Nika le akhawunti igama elinentsingiselo eliya kuboniswa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi eliza kusetyenziselwa uqinisekiso."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Iphasiwedi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Iphasiwedi esetyenziselwa ukuqinisekisa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Vula iPhasiwedi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Iphasiwedi yakho yoVulo, ukuba iyafuneka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Yenza Isixhobo Sisebenze"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Susa uphawu kule bhokisi ukucima esi sixhobo ekugcinweni ikopi."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Inkcazo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Igama lesi sixhobo (liya kusetyenziselwa ukugcina uqwalaselo kunye ne-SVN ukuba akukho gama lehosti elikho kuqwalaselo)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Idilesi ye-IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Le yiDilesi ye-IP esetyenziselwa ukunxibelelana nesixhobo."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Iseva ye-TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Iseva ye-TFTP ekhethwayo apho esi sixhobo sikopa uqwalaselo lwaso khona. Shiya ingenanto ukusebenzisa isetingi yeSeva ye-TFTP jikelele."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Isitshixo seHosti ye-SSH esiGciniweyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Thelekisa le algorithm yesitshixo sehosti kunye ne-SHA-1 hex fingerprint nesixhobo ngejelo elithembekileyo. Kwiseva, buyisela umendo ongezantsi ngefayile yesitshixo sehosti esesidlangalaleni ehambelanayo uze uqhube: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Sebenzisa isenzo sesixhobo ukuyicoca emva kotshintsho lwesitshixo olusemthethweni."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Uvimba weefayile"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Esi sisakhiwo solawulo esinxulumeneyo esisetyenziselwa ukugcina uqwalaselo."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lweShedyuli"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Kwenziwa kangaphi ugcino lwangasemva (Backup) lwesi sixhobo. Imihla ngemihla kunye nokuphinda kwenziwe rhoqo nge-10 kwenza ugcino rhoqo emva kweentsuku ezili-10; Ngenyanga kwenza ugcino lwenyanga yekhalenda ngokwenene."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Phinda Uqhube Rhoqo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Kwiishedyuli zeMihla ngemihla, phinda uqhube ugcino lwedatha qho ngeentsuku ezi-X. Kwiishedyuli zeVeki ngaphandle kweeNtsuku zeVeki ezikhethiweyo, luphinde luqhutywe qho ngeeviki ezi-X; xa iiNtsuku zeVeki zikhethiwe ugcino lwedatha lusebenza ngaloo mihla veki zonke kwaye le ndawo ayisebenzi."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Iintsuku zeVeki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Kwishedyuli yeVeki, u(ii)mhla weveki wokuqhuba ugcino lwedatha, veki nganye. Shiya ingenanto ukuze iqhube qho ngeeveki ze-Phinda uqhube qho endaweni yoko."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Iinyanga zoNyaka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kwishedyuli yeNyanga, i(zii)nyanga zonyaka zokuqhuba ugcino lwedatha."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Iintsuku zeNyanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Kwishedyuli yeNyanga, u(ii)mhla wenyanga wokuqhuba ugcino lwedatha (Okokugqibela = umhla wokugqibela wenyanga)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Iiveki zeNyanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kwishedyuli yeNyanga ngoMhla, i(zii)veki zenyanga zokuqhuba ugcino lwedatha."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Iintsuku zeVeki (Ngenyanga)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Kwishedyuli yeNyanga ngoMhla, u(ii)mhla weveki wokudibanisa nokhetho lweeVeki zeNyanga."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
