msgstr "Ixesha elingagqibekanga lokuphumla ngemayikhrosekondi (1/1,000,000 yomzuzwana)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Thatha njengokuba iphakanyisiwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Phawula le bhokisi ukuthatha ukuba esi sixhobo sihlala siphakanyisiwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Igama lolu hlobo lwesixhobo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Umyalelo weGama lomsebenzisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Esi sisikhokelo segama lomsebenzisi ekufuneka sitshatiswe xa ungena."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Umyalelo wePhasiwedi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Esi sisikhokelo sephasiwedi ekufuneka sitshatiswe xa ungena."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Ifayile yoqwalaselo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Le yindawo eqhelekileyo yefayile yoqwalaselo kwisixhobo esikude. Isetyenziselwa indlela ye-SCP neye-SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Kopa i-TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Lo ngumbhalo we-CLI osetyenziselwa ukuthumela ugcino kwiseva ye-tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Umyalelo wokuBamba"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Umyalelo okhethwayo osiphumo sawo sigcinwa njengoqwalaselo, endaweni yokukopela kwiseva ye-TFTP. Usoloko uqhuba nge-SSH, nokuba luluphi uHlobo loQhagamshelo, kwaye isixhobo asifuni seva ye-TFTP. Shiya ingenanto kwizixhobo ezikopa uqwalaselo lwazo kwi-TFTP. Umzekelo we-MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Bonisa uGuqulelo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Lo ngumbhalo we-CLI osetyenziselwa ukubonisa uguqulelo lwangoku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Isikhuthazo soQinisekiso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Lo ngumyalelo wokuqinisekisa omele uhambelane phambi kothumelo."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Qinisekisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Ngaba kukho isikhumbuzo sokuqinisekisa ukukopa uqwalaselo?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Nyanzela ukuQinisekisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Ngaba kukho isikhumbuzo sokuqinisekisa ngokunyanzelisa ukukopa uqwalaselo?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Jonga i-End kuqwalaselo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Jonga i-end kuqwalaselo?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Isaziso sokuCofa Naliphi na iQhosha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Umbhalo wokuthelekisa umyalelo ohlobo lwe-'Press Any Key To Continue'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Izikhuthazo zangemva koNgeno"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Izibini zokucela/impendulo ezikhethwayo ezithunyelwa kanye emva kokungena, phambi komyalelo wokukopa kwi-TFTP, enye ngomgca njenge-prompt|response. Umceli ungqamaniswa njenge-regular expression engakhathaliyo ngoonobumba abakhulu okanye abancinci kwisiphumo sesixhobo (ngoko ke ayinakuba no-| ngokwayo, kwaye izibiyeli kunye nezinye iimpawu ezikhethekileyo kufuneka zithintelwe, umz. Save \\\\[y/n\\\\]), kwaye impendulo ithunyelwa njengoko ichwetheziwe, okanye sebenzisa u-<CR> ukuthumela i-carriage return nje. Impendulo ithunyelwa kuphela xa umceli wayo eboniwe, nokuba kumpendulo yempendulo yangaphambili okanye kwisiphumo samva; kungenjalo isilumkiso siyarekhodwa kwaye akukho nto ithunyelwayo. Ezi ziphendulwa kuqala; umceli we-Any Key ongasentla uphendulwa kamva, ngelixa isixhobo sivulwa, ngoko ke umceli ophendulwe apha akaze afikelele ku-Any Key. Umzekelo: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Useto Ngokubanzi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Imowudi yoBoniso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Ngaba ii-Router Configs kufuneka ziboniswe kwi-Console okanye kwiThebhu ephezulu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Ikhonsoli"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Ithebhu ephezulu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Imigca yoMxholo ye-Diff yoQwalaselo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Inani elingagqibekanga leemigca engatshintshwanga eza kuboniswa phambi nasemva kotshintsho ngalunye xa kuthelekiswa ii-backup ezimbini. Ixabiso elikhulu lenza kube lula ukubona imeko yoqwalaselo ejikelezileyo. Oku kunokutshintshwa kuthelekiso ngalunye kwiphepha lokuThelekisa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha loqhagamshelwano liphelile"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Elona xesha liphezulu lokulinda ngemizuzwana xa kusekwa uqhagamshelwano lokuqala lwenethiwekhi kwisixhobo. Isixhobo esixhonyiweyo okanye esingafikelelekiyo siyashiywa emva kweli xesha lokuphela ukuze ugcino olucwangcisiweyo luqhubeke nezinye izixhobo eziseleyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Vala ngaphandle kokuphuma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Ukuba kukhethiwe, xa uvala uqhagamshelwano lwesixhobo, akukho myalelo uthi 'exit' okhutshwayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Isigcini soqhagamshelwano se-Debug"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Nokuba kumele kulogwe imveliso engqo yoqhagamshelwano lwesixhobo na"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Thatha njengokuba zonke izixhobo ziphakanyisiwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Nokuba kumele kuthathwe ukuba zonke izixhobo zinyusiwe na"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Iyure yokuKhuphela"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Iyure yosuku yokwenza ukhuphelo olupheleleyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Ishedyuli yokuZama kwakhona"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Ixesha lokulinda phambi kokuzama ukwenza ukhuphelo olongezelelweyo xa ukhuphelo olucwangcisiweyo lusilela"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuGcina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Inani leentsuku zokugcina iikopi zokugcina ezindala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Gcina iikopi zogcino zezixhobo ezingasebenziyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, ucoceko lokugcina aluyi kuzicima ii-backup ezidlulileyo zexesha ezizezezixhobo ezicinyiweyo okanye zezixhobo ezisusiweyo, ukuze uqwalaselo lwezixhobo eziyekisiweyo okanye ezingafikelelekiyo lugcinwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Iinketho zokuDlulisela"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Uhlobo loqhagamshelwano olungagqibekanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Uhlobo loqhagamshelwano olungagqibekanga olusetyenziselwa ukunxibelelana nesixhobo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Yahlula ngeSixhobo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Yahlula uLungelelwaniso olugciniweyo lube kwifolda yesixhobo ngasinye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Uvimba ongaPhantsi onoMhla"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Faka ulawulo oluncinci olusekelwe kumhla kwindlela yogcino (phambi kwefolda yesixhobo ngasinye), ukuze uqhobo ngalunye lugcinwe phantsi komhla walo wesipele, umz. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Ukucima kugcina ubeko olukhoyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Indlela ye-SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
