#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Qinisekisa iiKhii zeHosti ye-SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Rekhoda isitshixo sehosti ye-SSH sesixhobo ngasinye kuqhagamshelo lokuqala kwaye wale ukuthumela iziqinisekiso ukuba sitshintsha kamva. Imo ye-SSH/Telnet ayiyi kubuyela kwi-Telnet ngelixa uqinisekiso luvuliwe. Emva kotshintsho lwesitshixo olusemthethweni, sebenzisa isenzo sesixhobo ukucima isitshixo sehosti esigciniweyo."

