#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Bandakanya uMahluko woQwalaselo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Yongeza i-diff edityanisiweyo yesixhobo ngasinye esiqwalaselo saso sitshintshileyo ngexesha lokusebenza kwi-imeyile yogcino, ukuze umhloli abone kanye into etshintshileyo. Uqwalaselo oluyi-binary (olungekho mbhalo) luyatsitywa. Imigca eguquguqukayo etshintsha kulo lonke ugcino (i-Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' kunye ne-'Current configuration :', kunye ne-NX-OS '!Time:' kunye ne-'!Running configuration last done at:') ihlala ingahoywa. Isilumkiso: i-diff ithunyelwa njengombhalo ocacileyo kuye wonke umamkeli we-imeyile, ngoko ke inokutyhila uqwalaselo olufanele ukuhlala luyimfihlo; shiya u-Include Secrets in Diffs ungakhangelekanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Bandakanya iiMfihlo kuMahluko"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Thumela amaxabiso emfihlo kwi-diff ethunyelwe nge-imeyile njengoko enjalo. Xa ingakhethwanga (okungagqibekanga), imigca etshintshileyo ifunyanwa kulungelelwaniso olungahluzwanga kwaye iprintwe ihleliwe, isilele ivaliwe: imigca equlethe amagama afana nemfihlo (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) kunye nemigca yehosti ye-SNMP neyomsebenzisi icuthwa ibe ligama layo lokuqala elilandelwa ngu-&lt;secret hidden&gt;, kwaye umgca ngamnye webloko ye-PEM, ibloko yesatifikethi okanye ye-key-string, okanye ixabiso eliphindaphindwe kwimigca emininzi eliphakathi kweempawu zocaphulo, kunye nawuphi na umqolo we-hex okanye we-base64, ufihliwe; ibloko engapheliyo ifihla intsalela yolungelelwaniso. Oku kukwafihla imigca engenabungozi (umz. inkcazelo ekhankanya isitshixo), kodwa umgca ngamnye otshintshileyo usavela, uphawulwe nge-(changed) xa icandelo lawo elifihliweyo kuphela lahlukileyo, kwaye ibloko engapheliyo iyaphawulwa kwi-imeyile. Iibackup ezigciniweyo azitshintshwa nakanye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Iipateni zokuKhuphela ngaphandle ze-Diff"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Ii-regular expressions ezikhethwayo (enye ngomgca) ezingqamanisa imigca yoqwalaselo emayingahoywa xa kuthelekiswa, ukuze imigca eguquguqukayo efana nezikhombisi-xesha okanye iinombolo zothotho ingaveli njengotshintsho. Iphethini nganye ingqamaniswa ngokungakhathaliyo ngobukhulu boonobumba naphi na emgceni ngaphandle kokuba ibotshelelwe ngo-^ okanye u-$; iphethini engeyiyo i-regular expression esebenzayo ayihoywa."

